<%# Consolidated compliance reminder — lists exactly which items (KPIs, Documents, Valuations) are missing for the period. %>
Dear User,

<p>
  <%= @requesting_entity.name %> requires the following submissions for <strong><%= @period_label || "the current period" %></strong>:
</p>

<ul>
  <% @missing_items.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>
  Please submit the above on the Caphive platform at your earliest convenience.
</p>

Thank you.
